    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d234">

                <pb facs="0717" n="686" xml:id="pg686"/>

                <head>234. Letter From President Reagan to Yugoslav President Vlajkovic<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d234-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1985-10-31">October 31,
                        1985</date></dateline>
                    <salute>Dear Mr. President:</salute>
                </opener>
                <!--<pb facs="d234-2" n="2" type="facsimile" xml:id="d234-2"/>-->
                <p>I have learned that through an unfortunate and inadvertent administrative error,
                    you did not receive my invitation to the reception I hosted for heads of State
                    in New York on October 23. I regret any difficulty that this may have caused
                    you. Relations with Yugoslavia are very important to the United States, and I
                    had very much looked forward to meeting you in New York.</p>
                <p>Sincerely,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">Ronald Reagan</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
